    {
      "id": "30ce6a89-0883-4927-817e-373f12754d67",
      "name": "Prepare Sync Report",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "position": [
        4448,
        992
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const results = $input.all().map(item => item.json);\nconst synced = results.filter(item => item.status === 'synced').length;\nconst notFound = results.filter(item => item.status === 'not_found').length;\nreturn [{ json: {\n  ok: notFound === 0,\n  received: results.length,\n  synced,\n  not_found: notFound,\n  results,\n} }];"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "9e026c46-e4c7-4746-a702-7d03c9bcf884",
      "name": "Send Sync Report",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "position": [
        4704,
        992
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {
          "responseCode": "={{ $json.ok ? 200 : 207 }}"
        },
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ $json }}"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "1c695402-1de7-424a-9533-1752b0b66503",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1856,
        688
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 832,
        "content": "## Sync multi-location inventory to Medusa from any WMS\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow receives a warehouse stock payload from a WMS or ERP, validates and expands each SKU row, and looks up the corresponding inventory item in Medusa. It sets the absolute stock level for matched items, records unmatched SKUs without creating stray records, combines both branches, then returns a structured sync report to the webhook caller.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure the WMS or ERP to send POST requests to the \"When Stock Feed Received\" webhook URL.\n- Set up Medusa credentials in n8n for both Medusa nodes, including the backend URL and secret API token.\n- Send `stock_location_id` plus an `items` array containing `sku` and `stocked_quantity`.\n- Confirm every SKU exists as a Medusa Inventory Item and the stock location ID exists in the target store.\n\n### Customization\n\nAdjust the validation code to match the source system's stock schema, add webhook authentication before production, or route `not_found` results to an alerting or reconciliation workflow."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "06627fd2-48e1-408e-b8be-53bff0fb8100",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        2416,
        864
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 976,
        "height": 304,
        "content": "## Receive and resolve stock\n\nReceives the warehouse payload, validates required fields and quantities, expands the item array, looks up each Inventory Item by exact SKU, and decides whether the item can be synchronized."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "b6d925f9-3f65-45e5-a9de-68e9cd9d1108",
      "name": "Sticky Note5",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        4400,
        864
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 720,
        "height": 304,
        "content": "## Return inventory sync report\n\nCounts received, synchronized, and missing items, then returns HTTP 200 when every row succeeds or HTTP 207 when the feed contains unresolved SKUs."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "12d91368-621e-4337-b4ba-8792fe21ae04",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        3456,
        688
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 464,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "## Synchronize inventory level\n\nSets the absolute stocked quantity at the selected Medusa location, safely creating the level when needed, then records a normalized success result."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "42c07cd5-3b3b-4368-a591-f03d611f54d6",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        3456,
        1040
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 464,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "## Report missing inventory item\n\nRecords an actionable `not_found` result when no Medusa Inventory Item matches the incoming SKU. No inventory record is created automatically."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "26d14121-b6a5-4bb5-b6a7-37db447b2886",
      "name": "Sticky Note4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        4112,
        816
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "height": 336,
        "content": "## Merge stock results\n\nCombines the synchronized and missing-SKU branches into one result stream for a single response."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    }
